      "mechanism": "Not yet a weekly-review finding — seeded from the June–August budget sheets at the five-domain build. The sheets booked ₦900,250 to Savings and Emergency across three months. ₦305,000 survives, as the Cowrywise investment. ₦595,250 is gone, and the August building payment dropped from ₦500,000 to ₦200,000 to cover it. The same shape as P1: the line with no external party watching it is the line that gets cut, whether it is a content shoot or a savings transfer. Confirm or kill this at the first money-week review.",
